🧪 Proof of Concept (PoC Steps)
Step 1: Access Shared Directory

Navigate to the following network path:

\\ms\dist\fidev\PROJ\mkt1xladdin\qa\assemblies\DBConnection
Step 2: Identify Sensitive Files

Observe the presence of files such as:

*.enc (encrypted credential files)
*.txt (key-related files)
*.pass (possible plaintext credentials)
DBAccessConfig.xml (configuration file)
Step 3: Verify Co-location of Sensitive Data

Confirm that encrypted files and key-related files are stored in the same directory.

Step 4: Inspect File Content

Open .enc file using a text editor and observe encrypted/binary data.
Open .txt files and verify presence of readable or structured key material.
